d to your Library and right-click on <i>Drago Noka</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on <strong>Properties</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on <strong>Languages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select your desired language from the drop down menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Install the Game!</p></li></ul>",
